  "masked_text": "[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00151:f3c7b6b7d5fb]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00152:d4cb2bc36190]]\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00153:ab452bea72eb]] LP、NLP、QP、整数/MILP、0--1 模型生成器及小规模枚举核验；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00154:ab452bea72eb]] GA、PSO、SA、ACO、DE、贪心和 NSGA-II/MOPSO 公平比较框架；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00155:ab452bea72eb]] WOA、SSA、MFO 的受控插件与相同函数评估预算；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00156:ab452bea72eb]] Dijkstra、Floyd、SPFA、Prim、Kruskal、最大流、最小费用流和二分图匹配测试；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00157:ab452bea72eb]] Monte Carlo/离散事件仿真、单因素与全局敏感性接口；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00158:ab452bea72eb]] 2020B、2021C、2023B、2024B/C 的可行基线。\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00159:66cee2ed8c14]]\n\n",
